Short:        POSIX thread API as shared library
Author:       Thomas Frieden, Hans-Joerg Frieden
Uploader:     Thomas Frieden
Type:         dev/c
Version:      1.4
Architecture: ppc-amigaos >= 4.0.0

threads.library - a shared library implementing the POSIX
thread API (pthread)

This archive contains the binary as well as the header and
library files necessary to use the library in your own code.

See the include README file for more information.

Note: Replaced the old archive with a new one that's compatible to the SDK
directory structure

Update: This release fixes a problem in the link library that would lead to a
crash when threads.library is not installed.

